  "plain": "Rumors have reached the US Congress of a secret project inside the Department of Defense, the US military's headquarters department, that mixes human genes with what is described as \"non-human genetic material\". The words come from Lauren Boebert, a US congresswoman, heard on a November 2024 episode with the journalist Michael Shellenberger. She passes it on as a rumor that has come \"up to the hill\", and if it were true it would mean the military was quietly working on human and non-human hybrids."
